_1095255187" unitRef="uref_1243836679" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-12497">32,286,055</ix:nonFraction>, and recognized a gain on remeasurement of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationStepAcquisitionEquityInterestInAcquireeRemeasurementGain" contextRef="cref_174320865" unitRef="uref_1243836679" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-12498">4,206,055</ix:nonFraction> in other income in the unaudited condensed consolidated statements of operations for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026. Acquisition-related costs of $<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationSeparatelyRecognizedTransactionsAdditionalDisclosuresAcquisitionCosts" contextRef="cref_1520335571" unitRef="uref_1243836679" scale="0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" id="ixv-12499">100,000</ix:nonFraction> were expensed as incurred and are included in general and administrative expenses. </p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p> <ix:nonNumeric name="lqr:ScheduleOfPreviouslyHeldEquityInterestTableTextBlock" contextRef="cref_75887909" escape="true" id="ixv-6046"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;">The gain on remeasurement of the previously held equity interest was determined as follows:</p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0;">&#160;</p> <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tbody><tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF;"> <td style="width: 89%;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">Fair value of previously held equity interest at the acquisition date</span></td> <td style="width: 1%;">&#160;</td> <td style="width: 1%;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt;">$</span></td> <td style="width: 8%; text-align: right;"><sp